{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00220",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.93,
      "end_seconds": 7.29,
      "duration_seconds": 6.36,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I brought my bag, is it fine to leave it here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.52,
      "end_seconds": 11.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Right on time. Sit, please. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.58,
      "end_seconds": 19.1,
      "duration_seconds": 6.52,
      "text": "Oh, I've been losing weight without trying. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.07,
      "end_seconds": 22.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.21,
      "end_seconds": 30.03,
      "duration_seconds": 6.82,
      "text": "Right, it's been going on for three days. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.37,
      "end_seconds": 32.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Mm. Any night sweats as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.68,
      "end_seconds": 38.9,
      "duration_seconds": 6.22,
      "text": "Yes, for six months. About night sweats, pretty mild, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.08,
      "end_seconds": 43.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.86,
      "end_seconds": 55.52,
      "duration_seconds": 11.66,
      "text": "Um, not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.7,
      "end_seconds": 60.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Any coughing up blood or shortness of breath at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.25,
      "end_seconds": 64.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Well, uh, no, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.22,
      "end_seconds": 70.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Any chest pain or blood in the stool at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.67,
      "end_seconds": 76.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Okay, um, so no. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.31,
      "end_seconds": 79.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Okay, one moment, I'm updating your notes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.57,
      "end_seconds": 94.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "Okay, that's done. What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.12,
      "end_seconds": 99.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.51,
      "end_seconds": 101.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "What medicines do you take regularly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.88,
      "end_seconds": 115.16,
      "duration_seconds": 13.28,
      "text": "It's Glycomet, 500 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar. Iron tablets, once a day for my blood count. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.72,
      "end_seconds": 119.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.12,
      "end_seconds": 123.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.33,
      "end_seconds": 131.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "So, what about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.16,
      "end_seconds": 146.92,
      "duration_seconds": 14.76,
      "text": "Uh, yes, diabetes. It's the not knowing that gets to me. I have low haemoglobin, for about ten years. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.36,
      "end_seconds": 155.54,
      "duration_seconds": 7.18,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known low haemoglobin. We'll keep that in mind today. Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.29,
      "end_seconds": 158.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Yes, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.1,
      "end_seconds": 161.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.07,
      "end_seconds": 165.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "No, you know, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.02,
      "end_seconds": 168.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.63,
      "end_seconds": 185.17,
      "duration_seconds": 15.54,
      "text": "Hmm, not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 185.71,
      "end_seconds": 193.94,
      "duration_seconds": 8.23,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Saturation 95 percent, pulse is 88 beats a minute, blood pressure 107 over 74, temp 39.1 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.44,
      "end_seconds": 210.22,
      "duration_seconds": 15.78,
      "text": "Thanks. I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.18,
      "end_seconds": 214.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Thank you, um, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.35,
      "end_seconds": 221.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.57,
      "end_seconds": 224.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "I'll just listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.57,
      "end_seconds": 242.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "I can feel a couple of small glands in your neck, not tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.33,
      "end_seconds": 245.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Okay, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.06,
      "end_seconds": 249.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "I'll just listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.65,
      "end_seconds": 265.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Air entry is a bit reduced at the top of the right lung."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.55,
      "end_seconds": 276.32,
      "duration_seconds": 7.77,
      "text": "Alright, all done, thank you, please sit down. Is there anything you were hoping to get out of today's visit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.55,
      "end_seconds": 281.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Mostly I just want to understand what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.82,
      "end_seconds": 301.62,
      "duration_seconds": 16.8,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, I think we're dealing with an infection or something chronic going on, I can't say what yet at this stage. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.74,
      "end_seconds": 306.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Um, should I be worried about this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.59,
      "end_seconds": 323.83,
      "duration_seconds": 17.24,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with an infection or something chronic going on, I can't say what yet do well once it's treated properly. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been losing weight without trying for three days, and no blood in the stool or chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.01,
      "end_seconds": 326.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.83,
      "end_seconds": 330.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.68,
      "end_seconds": 335.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.02,
      "end_seconds": 343.84,
      "duration_seconds": 7.82,
      "text": "Let's get a chest X-ray, for weight loss and cough. I'd like to arrange a sputum test for chronic cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.72,
      "end_seconds": 345.71,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.21,
      "end_seconds": 364.55,
      "duration_seconds": 18.34,
      "text": "Weigh yourself once a week at the same time and note it down. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if you cough up blood or get breathless."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.05,
      "end_seconds": 368.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Um, got it, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.08,
      "end_seconds": 371.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Please come and see me in a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 373.16,
      "end_seconds": 373.86,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 374.61,
      "end_seconds": 380.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "Let me check that I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 381.66,
      "end_seconds": 386.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "So, I come back in a week. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.24,
      "end_seconds": 394.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Take care, and don't hesitate to call if anything changes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 394.93,
      "end_seconds": 398.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "No, I think that's everything. Thank you, doctor."
    }
  ]
}